"Hello %1$s,\n"
"\n"
"We detected a login to your account from a new IP address:\n"
"\n"
"IP Address: %2$s\n"
"Time: %3$s\n"
"\n"
"If this was not you, please contact your site administrator immediately."
msgstr ""
"Witaj %1$s,\n"
"\n"
"Wykryliśmy logowanie na Twoje konto z nowego adresu IP:\n"
"\n"
"Adres IP: %2$s\n"
"Czas: %3$s\n"
"\n"
"Jeśli to nie Ty, skontaktuj się natychmiast z administratorem witryny."

